1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,354
Watch P go round.

2
00:00:01,354 --> 00:00:05,924
Its two distances change, but their ratio stays at point six.

3
00:00:05,924 --> 00:00:07,213
That is an ellipse.

4
00:00:07,213 --> 00:00:16,588
Make e exactly one and you get a parabola; more than one, a hyperbola; and as e shrinks to zero, a circle.

